{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"zai-org/CodeGeeX","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/266","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/266/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/266/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/266/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/266","id":2786059526,"node_id":"I_kwDOIA6XT86mD-UG","number":266,"title":"【反馈】特定情形下造成 vscode 左侧栏 “源代码管理” 状态更新极其缓慢，同时阻塞其它插件的工作","user":{"login":"brianler","id":26024884,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDI0ODg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26024884?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler","html_url":"https://github.com/brianler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-01-14T02:36:17Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T10:07:20Z","closed_at":"2025-01-22T10:07:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"复现方法：\r\n\r\n```\r\npython-project/\r\n├── a.py   (12 bytes)\r\n├── b.py    (128 bytes)\r\n└── data.json  (7 MB，大文件)\r\n```\r\n\r\n在 vscode 中打开 a, b 文件时正常，但是一旦打开 data.json **大文件** 后，然后在 a, b, data 文件标签页切换时，就会造成 vscode 左侧栏 “源代码管理” 状态更新极其缓慢，这个过程至少需要 10 秒以上甚至 60s ，同时会阻塞其它插件的正常工作，直至侧栏 “源代码管理” 中的状态更新完成。即使没有对相关文件进行内容修改，仅切换不同文件的标签，也会触发上述问题。\r\n\r\n尝试过配置 .gitignore 和 .codegeexignore 来忽略相关文件，也尝试过在 codegeex 设置中忽略 json 语言的补全，但均没有效果。","closed_by":{"login":"brianler","id":26024884,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDI0ODg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26024884?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler","html_url":"https://github.com/brianler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/266/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/266/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}